{"summary":"远藤圭太在自家前院被绑架，绑匪留下不许报警的字条，柯南与毛利一家在时限内追查赎金交付地点。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-crab-whale-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0065"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"两名绑架者：一名男子与一名女子（页面人物表列为 Keita 的绑架者，未给出正式姓名）。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"两名绑架者以远藤圭太为人质向远藤圭吾勒索大笔日元，准备得手后携款潜逃。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"二人从远藤家前院绑走5岁的圭太，留下“孩子在我们手上，报警就杀了他，等我们联系”的字条，随后用电话遥控赎金交付流程，并在酒店准备逃跑。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"字条内容与赎金指示、绑匪对交付地点的选择，以及南水族馆相关线索帮助柯南锁定赎金交接与藏匿位置；两名绑架者在酒店准备出逃时被柯南当场击中制服。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南在酒店制服两名绑架者，圭太被安全送回父亲身边，二人被逮捕。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"A_Crab_and_Whale_Kidnapping_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Juzo Megure","Kamen Yaiba"],"solvedBy":"Conan Edogawa","dcwAirDate":"June 30, 1997","dcwFillerCaseNumber":"#25","locations":["Endo household"],"locationsSource":"A_Crab_and_Whale_Kidnapping_Case","locationsDropped":["Unknown Hotel"],"victims":[{"name":"Keita Endo","age":"5 years old","nameZh":"远藤圭太"}],"caseFactsSource":"A_Crab_and_Whale_Kidnapping_Case","locationsZh":["远藤家"]}